{"claims": [{"claim_id": "c1", "status": "supported", "witness": null, "reason": "The claim directly restates the calibrated probability of default (27.71%) found in evidence item p1."}, {"claim_id": "c2", "status": "supported", "witness": null, "reason": "The claim accurately reflects the model attribution for EXT_SOURCE_2 (a1), which has the largest absolute contribution (0.9843) and increases risk."}, {"claim_id": "c3", "status": "supported", "reason": "The claim is supported by the evidence. AMT_GOODS_PRICE (a2) and bureau_days_credit_mean (a4) have positive contributions, increasing risk, while AMT_ANNUITY (a3) has a negative contribution, decreasing risk. The claim does not assert causation, merely describes the model's behavior."}, "omissions"
